ansible-navigator.log

# Written by `devcontainer build` on whoever's machine ran it, and it pins every
# feature to the versions current at that moment. Committed by accident once, and
# it silently froze the image's features at 1.0.0 while ghcr had 1.1.0 -- the
# features resolve their tools at build time, so a lockfile here defeats the
# entire point. The image is the snapshot; this file is local noise.
devcontainer-lock.json
